#. type: Plain text
#: data/man/packetlens.1:8
msgid ""
"B<packetlens> is a comprehensive GTK4/Adwaita network analysis suite for "
"pcap/pcapng captures. Features include a multi-tab analysis interface, "
"Wireshark-style three-pane packet browser, protocol statistics, conversation "
"analysis, DNS and HTTP analysis, TLS certificate inspection, file extraction "
"from transfers, timeline visualization, BPF filtering, drag-and-drop file "
"loading, and multi-language support."
